he anointed me with his anointing oil.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"My brothers were handsome and tall;","poem":1},{"text":"but the Lord didn’t take pleasure in them.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"I went out to meet the Philistine,","poem":1},{"text":"and he cursed me by his idols.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"But I drew his own sword and beheaded him,","poem":1},{"text":"and removed reproach from the children of Israel.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"or, supernumerary","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":0}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_weu/PS2/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_weu/DAG/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_weu/MAN/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}